n></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot3\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Demon%20Trophy\"><img alt=\"Demon Trophy\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"38\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Demon_Trophy_7bbde8.gif\" width=\"38\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot4\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Demonrage%20Sword\"><img alt=\"Demonrage Sword\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Demonrage_Sword_d0c629.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot5\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Golden%20Legs\"><img alt=\"Golden Legs\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Golden_Legs_56cbef.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Maps and Pictures</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"map\">\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Abandoned Sewers\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"101\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Abandoned_Sewers_de727d.png\" width=\"125\"/></span> <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Abandoned Sewers Route\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"113\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Abandoned_Sewers_Route_25cbee.png\" width=\"125\"/></span> </div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">10.50<br/>July 7, 2014<br/>Summer Update 2014</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p>The <b>Abandoned Sewers</b> (aka <i>Catacombs</i>) is a forgotten place under <a href=\"#/wiki/Rathleton\">Rathleton</a>. Left to crumble away, fearsome creatures started to rule it. \n</p><p>Access to this place is gained through the <a href=\"#/quest/dark-trails-quest\">Dark Trails Quest</a>.\n</p><p>The combination of <a href=\"#/wiki/Demon\">Demons</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Grim%20Reaper\">Grim Reapers</a> make this place very good in terms of both Loot and Experience, specially for <a href=\"#/wiki/Paladin\">Paladins</a> because they can use Holy Damage spells, but also for other vocations and team hunts. \n</p><p>There is a chance that you'll find a <a href=\"#/wiki/Slime%20Slide\">Slime Slide</a> on the <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33392,32086,10\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">south-west (33392, 32086, 10)</a> part of the dungeon depending on the votes cast in the <a href=\"#/quest/rathleton-quest\">Rathleton Quest</a>. You can also use the small room south-east of the <a href=\"#/wiki/Slime%20Slide\">Slime Slide</a> as a safe place if you need. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Metal%20Gargoyle\"><img alt=\"Metal Gargoyle\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"60\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Metal_Gargoyle_fb9887.gif\" width=\"60\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Metal%20Gargoyle\">Metal Gargoyle</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">1,470</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">2,100</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">?</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>3-200× <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a> (common)</li>\n<li>1-2× <a href=\"#/wiki/Platinum%20Coin\">Platinum Coin</a> (common)</li>\n<li>Metal Jaw (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Strong%20Health%20Potion\">Strong Health Potion</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Strong%20Mana%20Potion\">Strong Mana Potion</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Metal Spats (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Slightly%20Rusted%20Armor\">Slightly Rusted Armor</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Bronze%20Gear%20Wheel\">Bronze Gear Wheel</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>Shiny Stone (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>Alloy Legs (rare)</li>\n<li>Metal Bat (rare)</li>\n<li>Underworld Rod (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Iron%20Ore\">Iron Ore</a> (very rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Life%20Ring\">Life Ring</a> (very rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Energy%20Ring\">Energy Ring</a> (very rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Grim%20Reaper\"><img alt=\"Grim Reaper\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Grim_Reaper_c1