Rod (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Death%20Ring\">Death Ring</a> (very rare)</li>\n<li>Glacier Kilt (very rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Skullcracker%20Armor\">Skullcracker Armor</a> (very rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Stone%20Skin%20Amulet\">Stone Skin Amulet</a> (very rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Demon\"><img alt=\"Demon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Demon_e0b935.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Demon\">Demon</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">6,000</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">8,200</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">1530 (<span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">500 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span>, <span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">250 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Fire Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Fire_Damage_Icon_7ba5fe.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span>, <span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">300 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Energy Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Electrified_Icon_9e8d1e.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span>, <span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">480 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Life%20Drain\"><img alt=\"Life Drain\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Life_Drain_Icon_bda9d3.g